{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:20:31.258593Z","id":"2f7a336048d42e9054c59a718a0ca00aab3b53c6ab481c2b7c94cce8bb81a477","body":{"detail":"The tokens use color-mix() (Chrome 111+) for --k-accent-soft, --k-hero-from/to and the badge, button and FAB tints, and the bars use backdrop-filter. A WebView older than Chrome 111 drops every declaration that uses color-mix, so the tonal buttons, selected tab pill and hero gradient lose their color. Verified so far: Playwright Chromium at 390x844, light and dark, against a scratch daemon (target/kit-shots/v3/*.png at the time). Next: load apps/clax_app/assets/kit/example/index.html in the app on a device and compare.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":10},"end":{"line":130},"content_hash":"8165007a82858fce58d8f90516ef6c8ff9ad6489e75a476be212ee0103cb0be9"},"summary":"kit.css is verified in desktop Chromium only, not in an Android WebView","tags":["unverified","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:20:31.258777Z","id":"5f2c634a6962c4df52cc8232439dd97fb7961884d51c83d97d5da7fc8044b935","body":{"detail":"TabBar falls back to the tab whose path is '/' when no tab's path is a prefix of the route, so a pushed screen outside every tab shows Home selected. Apps that nest pushed screens under a tab path (/activity/item/3) are marked right.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":143},"end":{"line":147},"content_hash":"e9f8d1f4c4a18723740c0a5c9df72c0983e4b466e8c59e18d9b470b502619960"},"summary":"On a screen that is not a tab (such as /settings) the tab bar marks the '/' tab as current","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:23:53.470851Z","id":"e5d4920d17ec8780c9a61e4bd07c3c65670e3eb17eae6561bd3f913d4e0bd0ad","body":{"detail":"Failure: any Button variant=\"gradient\" in dark mode. .k-btn.k-gradient sets color:#fff while the dark accents are light (#7c9bff default, about 2.6:1; the example's #3ddbb0/#2bb6c9, under 2:1). target/kit-shots/v3/settings-dark.png shows the Save label washing out. The FAB and filled button use --k-on-accent and read fine.","kind":"blocker","span":{"start":{"line":294},"end":{"line":294},"content_hash":"8e51c0c68efd3ab111a61759f199ac35f63206c93897d0b53a927fb9839a6b04"},"suggested_fix":"color: var(--k-on-accent) (and the same for any other hard-coded #fff over the accent).","summary":"Gradient buttons hard-code white text, illegible on a bright dark-mode accent","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:23:53.470959Z","id":"4515ed2c0bd3423aa995d3b9a27fb0ceeb9f6d4cb7570320fb0677f3fce85a75","body":{"detail":"Failure: any tabbed screen with a Fab and a List that reaches the bottom. .k-main pads var(--k-tab-h)+var(--k-s6) = 88px; the FAB (kit.css:478-489) spans from 72px to 128px above the bottom, so at full scroll the last row's amount and chevron sit under it (target/kit-shots/v3/home-light.png shows the overlap mid-list). Content also shows through the 0.82-alpha tab bar (insights-light.png: bars visible under the tab labels), which reads as a glitch.","kind":"blocker","span":{"start":{"line":203},"end":{"line":207},"content_hash":"3628b6590ecf0b42dfe829205f1c09861740004ffb2794a161c2d358aa34a385"},"suggested_fix":"Pad .k-main by a further 56px+gutter when a FAB is present (.k-app:has(.k-fab) .k-main, or a class App sets), and raise --k-bar alpha (about 0.94) so content under the tab bar is a tint, not legible text.","summary":"Bottom padding does not clear the FAB, so the last row's trailing value stays under it","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:23:53.471008Z","id":"7668a9052db4792bab6c91ec54f2fba025e2b7ab8150bd3620033ea453556ec2","body":{"detail":"Failure: AppBar large on any screen (home, activity, insights in the example). In large mode the bar row keeps --k-bar's distinct background and full --k-bar-h height while its title is hidden (kit.css:240), so the top shows a tinted strip holding only the actions, or nothing (target/kit-shots/v3/insights-light.png, home-light.png). Wasted space at the most valuable part of a phone screen; looks unfinished.","kind":"blocker","span":{"start":{"line":218},"end":{"line":240},"content_hash":"04798c73f26cb2528c8331f83a259609faea5f58eb20c584d305710cebf33933"},"suggested_fix":"While .k-large-mode is not scrolled, make the bar transparent (no background or backdrop) and, when there is no lead and no actions, collapse the row (or put actions on the large title's line) so the large title starts near the top.","summary":"A large-title AppBar leaves an empty 52px band above the title","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:23:53.471052Z","id":"1ba1e0457381cd00c7e8c164991eeeca6106fc07dfd78e053474fa2979150965","body":{"detail":"--k-fg-3 (#9696a0 light on --k-bar #f9f9fb, about 2.9:1; #6f6f78 dark on #161618, about 3.6:1) at 10.5px is below WCAG 4.5:1 for small text; inactive tabs look disabled in target/kit-shots/v3/*.png.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":257},"end":{"line":262},"content_hash":"4d8e805db6a935787bc21a8b66599a170236f3fe2a6d227ba1af1ef4505d68c4"},"suggested_fix":"Use --k-fg-2 for inactive tab labels, keep fg-3 for icons only if wanted.","summary":"Inactive tab labels are 10.5px at about 3:1 contrast","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:23:53.471109Z","id":"ac1e69d30de5adcd135ed172d4553f8ee0ab74fb424a644eeeec0abff48139f3","body":{"detail":"save/add/set/update/remove return the db promise; a rejection (invalid_argument for a non-object save(null) or an update on a missing doc, quota_exceeded, revoked; web/contract/0.2.61/db.d.ts:115-160) becomes an unhandled rejection and the UI shows nothing; the hooks' error state only reflects subscription errors. Memory mode diverges too: update on a missing doc silently no-ops (kit.js:643) where db rejects, and merges shallowly where db merges nested objects.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":578},"end":{"line":655},"content_hash":"507a3a1e34a2a8e4cb77774290f3f631bfe96fb81ab4d7f83c470d8cefaf0d14"},"suggested_fix":"Catch in the hooks: set state.error and toast(e.message, {tone:'danger'}) by default, still rejecting for callers that await.","summary":"Write failures from useDoc/useCollection are silent unless every caller catches","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:23:53.471161Z","id":"3ee3da0d1c0b7a51d532769b0eceecc4a4426873027a2e29ad641e6e34f7a6e2","body":{"detail":"getDb() resolves null whenever use('db') does (docs/contract.md: undeclared capability, outside the viewer). Nothing tells the model or the render step that data is not persisting.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":513},"end":{"line":522},"content_hash":"710b5eaa6ea75de9e2421b700340fb7640c3b1edee0fe78a2514c804d9e7f049"},"suggested_fix":"console.warn once when falling back while window.claude exists (the render tool's console capture then surfaces it).","summary":"The memory fallback is silent, so an app that forgot to declare db looks fine and loses every write on reload","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:23:53.471200Z","id":"3774506165981d2ba689f534810a215a40dfafae6ac9a88423be993a7860b24a","body":{"detail":"A model that imports back and writes back=${back} passes a function: backTo === true is false, so go(fn) throws on path.startsWith. Also useDoc returns a tuple while useCollection returns an object, an easy mismatch to guess wrong.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":164},"end":{"line":176},"content_hash":"4ece0bbdfd811ede0891f455cdeaa7c2c87bd5cfe4db88340df618cd51307357"},"suggested_fix":"Accept a function for back (call it), and document both return shapes prominently in the add_kit result.","summary":"AppBar's back prop shares its name with the exported back() function","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/README.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:23:53.471232Z","id":"c354e26c673d8facc5fd740255a1917f63f202f7a035e43f1aeea8192dcf97d1","body":{"detail":"preact.js and dates.js were built with --legal-comments=none and icons.js carries a one-line attribution only. MIT (preact, dayjs) and ISC (Lucide) require the copyright and permission notice in copies; Apache-2.0 (htm) requires the licence text. add_kit copies these files into every published app.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":8},"end":{"line":12},"content_hash":"5148fd7d4e6d9014c41cf0e631737f27afb9757155ae91ac3cce762d756982cf"},"suggested_fix":"Prepend a short header to each vendored file (package, version, SPDX ID, copyright line) and add kit/LICENSES.txt with the full texts, copied by add_kit with the kit part.","summary":"Vendored third-party code ships without its licence notices","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/README.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:27:36.623319Z","id":"8d6e24ab4cc04a978cc5d6538513a1400d25d18b10ef28354ad0fbb8c6b172f5","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c6adf244","summary":"preact.js, dates.js and icons.js open with a header naming package, version, licence and copyright; assets/kit/LICENSES.txt holds the MIT, Apache-2.0 and ISC texts and kitParts copies it with each vendored part (test/agent/tools/kit_tool_test.dart passes).","supersedes":"c354e26c673d8facc5fd740255a1917f63f202f7a035e43f1aeea8192dcf97d1","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:27:36.624442Z","id":"a15d47c665f7483c2e117c9fbddd96937ebd75f321363c65c0f81f956b74c6d6","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c6adf244","summary":"kit.css pads .k-main:has(.k-fab) by the FAB's height plus the gutter (and the tab bar when tabbed); --k-bar is 0.94 alpha. target/kit-shots/v4/home-bottom-dark.png: the last row (Rent, $1,200.00) clears the FAB at full scroll.","supersedes":"4515ed2c0bd3423aa995d3b9a27fb0ceeb9f6d4cb7570320fb0677f3fce85a75","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:27:36.625372Z","id":"7b13d2ea8f904c91f070d972765cac29377bc46aa44dd349da9bcc8ebb4182b1","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c6adf244","summary":"In large mode the AppBar is fixed and transparent until scroll, and .k-large-title.k-bare drops the bar height when the bar has no buttons (kit.js AppBar bare). target/kit-shots/v4/insights-dark.png (no band) and home-bottom-dark.png (compact bar after scroll).","supersedes":"7668a9052db4792bab6c91ec54f2fba025e2b7ab8150bd3620033ea453556ec2","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:27:36.626278Z","id":"32a3b99c71d64557d66a131a03e25c4820a8456fb444128d4e7fcbf2eccfe989","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c6adf244","summary":"Inactive tab labels are 11px in --k-fg-2 (#5c5c66 on #f9f9fb, about 6.5:1; #a9a9b3 dark, about 8:1); see target/kit-shots/v4/*.png.","supersedes":"1ba1e0457381cd00c7e8c164991eeeca6106fc07dfd78e053474fa2979150965","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:27:36.627172Z","id":"86108d2997de3da5fee306af9a3682e0dc50c5f66896f9e862c33b42db108f3a","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c6adf244","summary":"kit.css .k-btn.k-gradient now uses color: var(--k-on-accent); target/kit-shots/v4/settings-dark.png shows the Save label dark on the bright gradient.","supersedes":"e5d4920d17ec8780c9a61e4bd07c3c65670e3eb17eae6561bd3f913d4e0bd0ad","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:27:36.628078Z","id":"40bb1a7b3275b02626460aece8b4752c868172304f52f5c59ab1a79db0758e03","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c6adf244","summary":"TabBar no longer falls back to the '/' tab; target/kit-shots/v4/settings-dark.png shows no tab current on /settings.","supersedes":"5f2c634a6962c4df52cc8232439dd97fb7961884d51c83d97d5da7fc8044b935","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:27:36.628960Z","id":"fa345bdc6148beba0346ffe6b4ead976f43f382985dd90125bc5349657534faf","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c6adf244","summary":"AppBar back now takes true, a path or a function (back=${back} works); useDoc returns {data, save, ready, error} like useCollection's object, and the add_kit API text says so.","supersedes":"3774506165981d2ba689f534810a215a40dfafae6ac9a88423be993a7860b24a","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:27:36.629833Z","id":"a0836875f0b6d02b7821a6af1ef084f91e5f28d00eb516304820f2eb2e168f92","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c6adf244","summary":"getDb() logs one console.warn naming the missing {\"db\": {}} declaration when use('db') resolves null (kit.js getDb).","supersedes":"3ee3da0d1c0b7a51d532769b0eceecc4a4426873027a2e29ad641e6e34f7a6e2","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:27:36.630708Z","id":"1ce291ceb17a8635948b2bda3d5d23f6cf338f6b189771a5c6486b7b93abf6de","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c6adf244","summary":"serial() in kit.js shows a danger toast and rethrows on any write failure, so the caller's promise rejects; memory update rejects on a missing document and merges nested objects (deepMerge), as db does.","supersedes":"ac1e69d30de5adcd135ed172d4553f8ee0ab74fb424a644eeeec0abff48139f3","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
